{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atre: Dominance Wars is a strategy where you play as a Sorcerer who became an Elder. Your goal is to learn new spells, subdue your enemies and ascend to God. In later stage of the game you can also get access to God spells which can change the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While doing that you will encouter The Merge that slowly destroys your playable area, there are ways to counter it by capturing those regions and binding them to your Throne which is your seat of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Betray or get betrayed (or prevent both)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three ways to win the game, each of those victories brings certain risks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player can win the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can 100% expect betrayal from anyone in their empire once the victory count starts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gives and interesting push and pull and the game stays intense until the end, as <strong>victories shift in the last moment</strong>, and <strong>allies betray you</strong>, or <strong>enemies start working together.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/bc8b38822f709270c4510747d58b3c9e.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/bc8b38822f709270c4510747d58b3c9e.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/bc8b38822f709270c4510747d58b3c9e.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Armies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an Empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f6a32192d5cefb05896092a1036776b0.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/922333a0bce2aafe18d054573d2ca63f.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/922333a0bce2aafe18d054573d2ca63f.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/922333a0bce2aafe18d054573d2ca63f.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research unit mutations and transform your armies to obliterate any enemy you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/5f2ead6ab63dab358af68d530cf9b778.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span>\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/db967158164fc552f16642a4be4f9c07.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/db967158164fc552f16642a4be4f9c07.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/db967158164fc552f16642a4be4f9c07.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build thriving cities, construct special structures and amass legions of devoted followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/abb54142c856baa3d99ac575cbdd5957.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/c1d1640f3d981a1fc98fbd51e4a18bba.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/c1d1640f3d981a1fc98fbd51e4a18bba.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/c1d1640f3d981a1fc98fbd51e4a18bba.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Elder, research spells and gain a diverse set of powers - from spreading prosperity to bringing total annihilation. The most powerful Elders can ascend to Godhood and open the Gate between worlds. During this period you are granted absolute power and magic that can destroy the land itself, but\u2026 this power comes with a price, and the Gate between worlds stays open for powerful entities from the other side\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/6d11f105497ac0031a9a2ca9cd80c0ca.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/010abc18f0c2d5117c4bcca7b98eec29.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/010abc18f0c2d5117c4bcca7b98eec29.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/010abc18f0c2d5117c4bcca7b98eec29.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magically bind various gems to craft unique artifacts that imbue you or your armies with unparalleled might. Name the artifacts as you wish, using ancient Glagolitic script.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/80d8fc5b5e7b4fa75bec8be4693a2d15.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f903a4782a6f689902226d8e946f6338.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f903a4782a6f689902226d8e946f6338.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f903a4782a6f689902226d8e946f6338.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Given to you by the gods, immortal Avatars will lead armies in your name. With each victory they gain experience; level them up, equip them with powerful artifacts and shape them into juggernauts of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/fd3abe9dbf9e127877799e5be4983818.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/cf46efbb51c54c06936e1ddbf5d00dd3.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/cf46efbb51c54c06936e1ddbf5d00dd3.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/cf46efbb51c54c06936e1ddbf5d00dd3.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your Envoy roam the shattered world, and send your Avatars to conquer it all. Capture cities, construct magical monoliths and create a dominion that bends to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/d541076d94a1f2ada74d2bbba8c3fab1.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/42bac70255ae611917bcc189989610f2.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/42bac70255ae611917bcc189989610f2.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/42bac70255ae611917bcc189989610f2.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The way the world is generated depends on the magical attributes you choose when you create your character. So the world responds to your choices from the very beginning. The events you come across also change depending on these magical attributes. Take note: Events are steeped in the lore of this new world and when presented with multiple choices, unexpected consequences may arise if you don\u2019t do some detective work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this mechanic, Atre: Dominance Wars promises a fresh experience for every different playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/66a6be79182ecb54ac6047f1b903970f.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atre is a realm with <strong>4 different worlds</strong> coexisting within: <strong>Wud</strong>, <strong>Haad</strong>, <strong>Erol</strong>, and <strong>Men</strong>. These worlds are under a <strong>constant threat</strong> of an ancient cataclysm called <strong>The Merge\u00a0</strong>that <strong>violently tears apart</strong> these 4 worlds and then merges them randomly. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the world itself is <strong>constantly changing</strong>, barely existing under the threat of The Merge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to <strong>escape</strong> The Merge is by finding the <strong>Thrones</strong>. These magical structures can be activated by powerful Sorcerers who give their bodies to the Throne for immortality, becoming <strong>Elders</strong> in the process. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elders can then use their magic to <strong>anchor the lands</strong> under their rule to the Throne itself, <strong>protecting their domain</strong> from the Merge.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/7aeab884275d3280bc00ed11dd454ad3.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/7aeab884275d3280bc00ed11dd454ad3.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/7aeab884275d3280bc00ed11dd454ad3.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/0d5c0b96afe9d82b3db1b2713e2b40c3.avif?t=1772882226\" width=1180 height=352 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2805850?t=1772882226","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/b074b0fc23c2ce6e4e845f6fee6f6df96efedcd9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772882226","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/65fc229d52bc858646a20f4aaef1766bcad5abc8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772882226","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/65fc229d52bc858646a20f4aaef1766bcad5abc8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772882226","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3922270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atre: Dominance Wars is a strategy where you play as a Sorcerer who became an Elder. Your goal is to learn new spells, subdue your enemies and ascend to God. In later stage of the game you can also get access to God spells which can change the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While doing that you will encouter The Merge that slowly destroys your playable area, there are ways to counter it by capturing those regions and binding them to your Throne which is your seat of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Betray or get betrayed (or prevent both)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three ways to win the game, each of those victories brings certain risks.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only one player can win the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can 100% expect betrayal from anyone in their empire once the victory count starts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This gives and interesting push and pull and the game stays intense until the end, as <strong>victories shift in the last moment</strong>, and <strong>allies betray you</strong>, or <strong>enemies start working together.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/bc8b38822f709270c4510747d58b3c9e.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/bc8b38822f709270c4510747d58b3c9e.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/bc8b38822f709270c4510747d58b3c9e.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your Heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your Armies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an Empire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your cities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f6a32192d5cefb05896092a1036776b0.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/922333a0bce2aafe18d054573d2ca63f.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/922333a0bce2aafe18d054573d2ca63f.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/922333a0bce2aafe18d054573d2ca63f.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research unit mutations and transform your armies to obliterate any enemy you come across.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/5f2ead6ab63dab358af68d530cf9b778.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span>\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/db967158164fc552f16642a4be4f9c07.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/db967158164fc552f16642a4be4f9c07.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/db967158164fc552f16642a4be4f9c07.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build thriving cities, construct special structures and amass legions of devoted followers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/abb54142c856baa3d99ac575cbdd5957.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/c1d1640f3d981a1fc98fbd51e4a18bba.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/c1d1640f3d981a1fc98fbd51e4a18bba.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/c1d1640f3d981a1fc98fbd51e4a18bba.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an Elder, research spells and gain a diverse set of powers - from spreading prosperity to bringing total annihilation. The most powerful Elders can ascend to Godhood and open the Gate between worlds. During this period you are granted absolute power and magic that can destroy the land itself, but\u2026 this power comes with a price, and the Gate between worlds stays open for powerful entities from the other side\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/6d11f105497ac0031a9a2ca9cd80c0ca.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/010abc18f0c2d5117c4bcca7b98eec29.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/010abc18f0c2d5117c4bcca7b98eec29.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/010abc18f0c2d5117c4bcca7b98eec29.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magically bind various gems to craft unique artifacts that imbue you or your armies with unparalleled might. Name the artifacts as you wish, using ancient Glagolitic script.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/80d8fc5b5e7b4fa75bec8be4693a2d15.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f903a4782a6f689902226d8e946f6338.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f903a4782a6f689902226d8e946f6338.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/f903a4782a6f689902226d8e946f6338.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Given to you by the gods, immortal Avatars will lead armies in your name. With each victory they gain experience; level them up, equip them with powerful artifacts and shape them into juggernauts of destruction. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/fd3abe9dbf9e127877799e5be4983818.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/cf46efbb51c54c06936e1ddbf5d00dd3.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/cf46efbb51c54c06936e1ddbf5d00dd3.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/cf46efbb51c54c06936e1ddbf5d00dd3.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your Envoy roam the shattered world, and send your Avatars to conquer it all. Capture cities, construct magical monoliths and create a dominion that bends to your will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/d541076d94a1f2ada74d2bbba8c3fab1.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/42bac70255ae611917bcc189989610f2.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=326 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/42bac70255ae611917bcc189989610f2.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/42bac70255ae611917bcc189989610f2.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The way the world is generated depends on the magical attributes you choose when you create your character. So the world responds to your choices from the very beginning. The events you come across also change depending on these magical attributes. Take note: Events are steeped in the lore of this new world and when presented with multiple choices, unexpected consequences may arise if you don\u2019t do some detective work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With this mechanic, Atre: Dominance Wars promises a fresh experience for every different playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/66a6be79182ecb54ac6047f1b903970f.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=81 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Campaign</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atre is a realm with <strong>4 different worlds</strong> coexisting within: <strong>Wud</strong>, <strong>Haad</strong>, <strong>Erol</strong>, and <strong>Men</strong>. These worlds are under a <strong>constant threat</strong> of an ancient cataclysm called <strong>The Merge\u00a0</strong>that <strong>violently tears apart</strong> these 4 worlds and then merges them randomly. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So the world itself is <strong>constantly changing</strong>, barely existing under the threat of The Merge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way to <strong>escape</strong> The Merge is by finding the <strong>Thrones</strong>. These magical structures can be activated by powerful Sorcerers who give their bodies to the Throne for immortality, becoming <strong>Elders</strong> in the process. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elders can then use their magic to <strong>anchor the lands</strong> under their rule to the Throne itself, <strong>protecting their domain</strong> from the Merge.\u00a0 </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/7aeab884275d3280bc00ed11dd454ad3.poster.avif?t=1772882226\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/7aeab884275d3280bc00ed11dd454ad3.webm?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/7aeab884275d3280bc00ed11dd454ad3.mp4?t=1772882226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/extras/0d5c0b96afe9d82b3db1b2713e2b40c3.avif?t=1772882226\" width=1180 height=352 /></span></p>","developers":["Ironward"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805850/8a606308706b8f376f3e23dd79cd1d8847fdac27/header.jpg?t=1772882226","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Atre: Dominance Wars\u2122 is an intellectual property of Iron Ward j.d.o.o.<br />\r\n\u00a9 2023 Iron Ward j.d.o.o. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<